ode, switch to record mode only with FIZEAU_RECORD_PROVIDER_CASSETTES=1, redact Authorization/API-key headers before saving, provide stable request matching suitable for /v1/models, /metrics, /slots, and chat completions, and fail when a replay interaction is missing. Out of scope: actual vLLM or llama-server cassettes, server bootstrapping, routing changes, and provider-specific parsing.\n    \u003c/description\u003e\n    \u003cacceptance\u003e\n1. go test ./internal/provider/... -run \u0026#39;VCR|Cassette|Replay\u0026#39; passes. 2. go.mod declares gopkg.in/dnaeon/go-vcr.v4 or a current maintained go-vcr import as a direct test dependency. 3. Replay mode is default without network access and fails on missing cassette interactions. 4. Record mode is gated by FIZEAU_RECORD_PROVIDER_CASSETTES=1. 5. Saved cassettes do not contain Authorization headers or API keys.\n    \u003c/acceptance\u003e\n    \u003clabels\u003earea:test, kind:infra\u003c/labels\u003e\n    \u003cmetadata parent=\"fizeau-c58969b6\" spec-id=\"FEAT-003\" base-rev=\"400dbc56519a115eaa6b27ed2e830113fe8f937b\" bundle=\".ddx/executions/20260506T012231-48a2b4a8\"/\u003e\n  \u003c/bead\u003e\n  \u003cgoverning\u003e\n    \u003cref id=\"FEAT-003\" path=\"docs/helix/01-frame/features/FEAT-003-providers.md\"\u003eFeature Specification: FEAT-003 — LLM Providers\u003c/ref\u003e\n  \u003c/governing\u003e\n\u003c/execute-bead\u003e\n","metadata":{"attempt_id":"20260506T012231-48a2b4a8","base_rev":"400dbc56519a115eaa6b27ed2e830113fe8f937b","bead_id":"fizeau-5d4b5f68","bundle_path":".ddx/executions/20260506T012231-48a2b4a8","correlation_id":"fizeau-5d4b5f68:20260506T012231-48a2b4a8","prompt_file":".ddx/executions/20260506T012231-48a2b4a8/prompt.md","prompt_sha":"6368c983c989609829a45c7f2b7c9719c586cb9cf0c2b06182d0639a60f5c2f8","role":"implementer","session_id":"eb-be2de83c","worker_id":""}}}
